        "The key design: `step_ray_euclidean` is a **drop-in replaceable function**.\n",
        "To render a non-Euclidean geometry on $\\mathbb{R}^3$, we simply provide a\n",
        "different `step_ray` that integrates a geodesic ODE—for instance\n",
        "$\\ddot{\\gamma}^k + \\Gamma^k_{ij}\\,\\dot{\\gamma}^i\\,\\dot{\\gamma}^j = 0$\n",
        "—and the rest of the renderer stays unchanged.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Passing through the unknot\n",
        "\n",
        "Now let us visualise the idea of *passing through* the unknot.\n",
        "We add an arrow (a cylinder with a cone tip) that pierces the torus,\n",
        "representing the act of crossing from one \"world\" to another."
